**1. A wearable adult-entertainment costume system comprising:**

a wearable costume body configured to be worn by a user;

a plurality of light-emitting diodes supported by the wearable costume body and arranged to present illuminated content;

a propeller supported by the wearable costume body;

an electric motor operatively coupled to the propeller to rotate the propeller;

a wireless communication interface configured to receive user input from a remote device;

a non-transitory onboard memory configured to store at least one customizable message and operating instructions;

a processor communicatively coupled to the plurality of light-emitting diodes, the electric motor, the wireless communication interface, and the onboard memory, the processor being configured to control illumination of the light-emitting diodes and operation of the electric motor at least partly in response to the received user input and the stored operating instructions;

an on/off control operable to selectively activate and deactivate at least a portion of the wearable adult-entertainment costume system; and

a message-customization control operable to modify the at least one customizable message presented using the plurality of light-emitting diodes.
